## Setting Up the App

### 1. Remote Data Endpoint

Create a JSON file containing the array of compound objects (the original dataset) and **pin it to IPFS** using Pinata or web3.storage. Then set `REACT_APP_DATA_URL` to the public gateway URL, e.g.:
